ook:Tablespoon|tbsp]] [[Cookbook:Tomato Paste|tomato paste]]\n* 1 large [[Cookbook:Onion|onion]], [[Cookbook:Dice|diced]]\n* 1 tbsp smoked [[Cookbook:Paprika|paprika]]\n* 1½ pounds red [[Cookbook:Potato|potatoes]], quartered but left unpeeled\n* 2 tbsp [[Cookbook:Olive Oil|olive oil]], divided\n* ¼ cup beef [[Cookbook:Broth|broth]]\n* 2 tbsp finely-chopped fresh [[Cookbook:Rosemary|rosemary]]\n\n== Procedure ==\n#Heat a 6-quart [[Cookbook:Dutch Oven|Dutch oven]] over medium high heat. Add oil and heat for one more minute.\n#Season shortribs with salt and freshly ground black pepper. Add to Dutch oven and cook until deeply browned on all sides. Remove and keep warm.\n#Add remaining oil and onion and [[Cookbook:Sautéing|sauté]] until lightly browned at the edges. Add potatoes, shortribs, and remaining ingredients except rosemary.\n#Place in a cold [[Cookbook:Oven|oven]] then turn oven to 250°F and bake for 5½ hours.\n#Remove and skim fat. Serve sprinkled with rosemary.\n\n[[Category:Recipes using beef rib]]\n[[Category:Recipes using potato]]\n[[Category:Recipes using wine]]\n[[Category:Recipes for stew]]\n[[Category:Braised recipes]]\n[[Category:Main course recipes]]\n[[Category:Recipes using beef broth and stock]]","isRecipe":true,"recipe":{"name":"Wine Braised Shortribs","nameAr":null,"servings":null,"servingsSourceText":null,"ingredients":[{"id":"source-line-1","name":"3 pounds English-cut shortribs","sourceText":"3 pounds English-cut shortribs","amountText":"3 pounds English-cut shortribs","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-2","name":"Salt","sourceText":"Salt","amountText":"Salt","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-3","name":"Freshly-ground black pepper","sourceText":"Freshly-ground black pepper","amountText":"Freshly-ground black pepper","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-4","name":"¼ cup Worcestershire sauce","sourceText":"¼ cup Worcestershire sauce","amountText":"¼ cup Worc